The QR Code Based Secure Offline Banking System allows users to perform banking transactions without an internet connection. 
In this system, transaction details such as user ID and amount are converted into a secure QR code. The receiver scans the QR code to complete the transaction. 
The data is encrypted to ensure security and prevent fraud. 
Transactions are stored locally and synchronized with the bank server when the internet becomes available. This system helps people in rural or low-network areas perform safe and easy digital payments.
